NOTE4C image library — CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)

The 25 illustrations in this directory (svg/*.svg and the tiles generated from
them in src/core/library/art/) are original drawings made by the NOTE4C
Control Tower project contributors for the NOTE4C e-paper panel.

To the extent possible under law, the NOTE4C project contributors have waived
all copyright and related or neighboring rights to these works. You can copy,
modify, distribute and use them, even for commercial purposes, without asking
permission. Attribution is appreciated but not required:
"Illustrations: NOTE4C Control Tower image library (CC0)".

Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

No third-party artwork, fetched image or AI-generated image was used. The
"Great wave" is an original drawing in the general manner of a woodblock print.
